be precise  if you want people to listen to you if  you want to get media you want to get  partners you want to get customers on  board with your company then they have  to quickly understand what it is that  your business does and how it helps them  and it comes from being precise in your  messaging  this week i've had a lot of  entrepreneurs for some reason that have  come to me and have not been precise  in what they're asking for  this morning i met with an entrepreneur  and i love the direction of his company  i love what he stands for but as he's  telling me his story  i'm starting to get bored  he's rambling on about all sorts of  things that are not relevant or  interesting  and i start to daydream  i start to think about other projects  i'm working on other people that i'm  going to be meeting and i'm fighting i'm  fighting to stay with him and to listen  i'm really trying but he's losing me  constantly and and i had to stop him  halfway through and say  i'm starting to zone out  like you need to really get to the point  and be precise with what it is you're  doing and how i can help you here today  like i am here for an hour this coffer  meeting to help you  tell me what i can do to help you but i  was struggling to find that answer  i get it happen to me a lot when people  write in to me as well i had two emails  this week from entrepreneurs who just  wrote like a novel in their emails and  i'm scrolling and scrolling and  scrolling and scrolling and scrolling  just non-stop it seems  and there's no way i have the time to  read all of that and to give some advice  if you are trying to reach out to  successful people you'll find that they  really value their time that's what  makes them successful and the more  successful they are the more they're  going to value their time and the less  time they're going to have to waste on  something that is not relevant  interesting or helpful to them so you  have to quickly get to the point and be  precise now when somebody writes me  those crazy long emails i'll usually  write back and i'll say  love to help you please rewrite this and  take 80 of it out and it forces them to  be precise  and cut down their language into  something that i can digest more easily  and for those who do  i'll write back i'll try to help them as  much as i can  and for those who don't if they don't  invest the time in themselves to create  copy  that is relevant and powerful then why  should i waste my time trying to help  you  if you have this challenge if you are  writing crazy long emails to people and  you can't seem to get your point across  quickly  all the business advice it's going to be  really hard to get out of people like  for these people who write into me  i can't really even help you until i  understand what it is that you do so  your biggest business problem  is  condensing your thoughts into something  that people can understand  and i know it's it can be a huge ask  especially if you're first getting  started in a business i remember when i  had my first presentations i remember  one in particular was in dubai and i was  so nervous i got up on stage and there's  hundreds of people in the audience it's  my first real presentation  and i wanted to cram so much in there  that i started talking really quickly  and and  sharing everything that i could on the  topic i felt like i'd add ad  and just share everything not miss any  detail  and as a result i lost most of the  people and they came to me and said we  love your energy but we have no idea  what you were talking about  and this happens to all of us i know  it's very nerve-wracking  but it's so important that you practice  this  it's so important you have a good  elevator pitch to explain what it is  your business is all about and it's so  important when you're reaching out to  people for help  that they quickly and easily understand  what you do so then they can give you  some good advice to actually help you  so your homework for today  is be precise create a quick elevator  pitch that anybody can understand what  it is that you do  practice it talk to yourself in the  mirror prepare  and the next time you go out and talk to  somebody  let that shine through and only say the  words you need to to get your point  across  believe  for those of you watching if you liked  the video please give it a thumbs up  below it always makes me want to do more  videos for you and i want to hear you  have to think please leave a comment  below let me know your thoughts i'd love  to do a video response for you thank you  so much and i'll see you soon

